---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="NDPS Cases Defence in Chennai" description="Defence in narcotic drugs and psychotropic substances matters.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-gold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Practice Area</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-navy mb-6">NDPS Cases</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink/90 space-y-5 leading-relaxed">
      <p>Cases under the Narcotic Drugs and Psychotropic Substances Act require strict scrutiny of search, seizure, sampling, and compliance with statutory safeguards. Procedural defects frequently become decisive.</p>
      <p>We examine the legality of the raid, the role of independent witnesses, chain of custody, and the applicability of commercial quantity presumptions. Bail applications in NDPS matters are approached with particular care given the statutory restrictions.</p>
      <p>Early engagement helps preserve grounds that may be lost if the investigation proceeds without challenge.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10">
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-navy text-cream px-8 py-3 rounded-sm hover:bg-navy/90 transition">Discuss Your Matter</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
